"/><figcaption>日本民俗5. 在手掌上寫三次人字再吞下能緩解緊張（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本民俗5. 在手掌上寫三次人字再吞下能緩解緊張（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251027/1059430732470030336791652.png/CioJNJXjKWhOJ_QK9YRvbbXee5fMlJa9gwnmVIMJ5lQ\"/><figcaption>日本民俗5. 在手掌上寫三次人字再吞下能緩解緊張（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「ETtoday」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T04:44:24.303259+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1514,"images":31,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}